      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Until execution ships, Layer 3 is represented by the Layer-1 proxy — a strong PREDICTOR of mutation score, but not the real thing.\nThe execution stage is the clean seam between this report and its sibling:  KGA scores retrieval  ·  TPD scores planning  ·  both hand off to execution.",
